      "text": "one of the heaviest rainy seasons in three decades. Reservoirs filled beyond 97% capacity. Dam operations and seasonal rains pushed the river past protective embankments. Surging flows flooded homes, farms, and schools in Deir Ezzor and Raqqa. several children drowned The event unfolds across atypical seasonal precipitation and heavy rainfall.",
